Follow `AGENTS.md` and `docs/build-standard.md`:
- Never introduce `sorry`, `admit`, `native_decide`, or custom axioms outside `lean/PalomarChallenge.lean`.
- Keep all code Apache-2.0 and docs/paper/data CC-BY-4.0 per `REUSE.toml`.
- Commit and push directly to `main`; CI is informational only (no gating hooks or branch protection).
- Keep `[LEAN-6K]`, `[EXACT-COMP]`, `[NUMERICAL-APPROX]`, and `[OPEN]` epistemic boundaries explicit.
